      "content": "TL 11 SW                  REDBOURN             CHURCH END (west side) REDBOURN COMMON 5/154                                          Chest tomb in churchyard of Parish Church of St Mary to  Grimstead family. GV                                             II Chest tomb to Grimstead family.  About 7 metres NW of W tower. Early-mid C18.  Marble sides.  Stone base and top.  Gadrooned angles with cherubs heads.  Short sides with a coat of arms and a carved allegory on time and death. Listing NGR: TL0997111574"
